{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里既不安，又有股不肯停的劲；身体先绷紧，脑子没跟上，连在等什么、舍不得什么都说不清。\",\n      \"key\": \"说不清\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得由着事情照旧就是认了它本该如此，所以硬撑着不让自己垮下去，可也想停一停，怕投入后失去别的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"认了它本该如此\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的感觉一回来，身体先有了往前的冲动；可过去回不来，他还不知道该往哪走。\",\n      \"key\": \"往前的冲动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想弄清这一步值不值得冒险，可刚有把握，舍不得又回来，他又不敢信刚才的判断，为非得想透才肯动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得又回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"恢复并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"补回由着事情照旧在他看来等于承认现状本该如此的判断，同时保留硬撑、想停和害怕投入后失去东西的拉扯。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e8a585f3-c2f7-41e9-8ac8-0bec63d42707", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012309836407Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:23:36.079398+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aba54dc2ab0ef088640c1caa1c0bb241f5fb1065f32d1f75667466a7bf93dc1f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal